OL,3,GNEWSANew order issued against
OL,4,Aunauthorised development
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new enforcement notice has been
OL,7,Fserved by a council over an
OL,8,Funauthorised traveller development near
OL,9,Fa nuclear weapons facility.
OL,11,FWest Berkshire Council withdrew a
OL,12,Fprevious notice regarding the site
OL,13,Fsouth of Reading Road and opposite the
OL,14,FAtomic Weapons Establishment (AWE) in
OL,15,FAldermaston.
OL,17,FIt said the new one, issued last month,
OL,18,Fmeans there is "no ambiguity" about it
OL,19,Fcovering all of the unauthorised
OL,20,Fdevelopment.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
