OL,3,GNEWSANew order issued against
OL,4,Aunauthorised development
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn interim injunction granted by the
OL,7,FHigh Court in December remains
OL,8,Funaffected, with the council awaiting
OL,9,Fan outcome of recent hearings, which
OL,10,Fwill determine whether the injunction
OL,11,Fcan continue.
